BT 1 0 0 1 66.61417 515.0551 Tm (1. Print page 1 at 100% on A4 paper, landscape \(thicker paper or card is better\). Check the 100 mm bar with a ruler.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 66.61417 500.0315 Tm (2. Cut out the three strips along the dashed lines. The slide \(middle\) is 34 mm tall.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 66.61417 485.0079 Tm (3. Glue the two outer strips onto card so the edge of A and the edge of D face each other, 34 mm apart \(the slide's height\), with the slide sliding between.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 66.61417 469.9843 Tm (   Without card you can lay the three strips side by side on a table, edges touching, and slide the middle one by hand.) Tj T* ET
